@startuml diagram
!include ../../theme.iuml

title Správa uživatelů: agregát User a feature slices

package "UserManagement Bounded Context" as UM {

  package "Domain" as Domain {
    rectangle "**User**\n<size:12>agregátní kořen</size>" as User
    note right of User
      register(UserId, name, Email, HashedPassword): self
      changeEmail(Email): void
      changeName(string): void
      --
      implements UserInterface,
      PasswordAuthenticatedUserInterface
    end note

    rectangle "UserId\nEmail\nHashedPassword\n<size:12>hodnotové objekty</size>" as VOs
    rectangle "UserRegistered\n<size:12>doménová událost</size>" as Event #1B202A
    rectangle "DuplicateEmailException" as Ex
    rectangle "UserRepository\n<size:12>rozhraní</size>" as Repo
  }

  package "Infrastructure" as Infra {
    rectangle "DoctrineUserRepository" as DoctrineRepo
  }

  package "Feature slices" as Slices {
    rectangle "Registration\n<size:11>Command + Controller</size>" as S1
    rectangle "Authentication\n<size:11>Controller</size>" as S2
    rectangle "Profile\n<size:11>Query + Controller</size>" as S3
  }
}

User ..> VOs : skládá se z
User ..> Event : register() nahraje
User ..> Ex : při kolizi e-mailu

Repo <|.. DoctrineRepo

S1 ..> Repo
S2 ..> Repo
S3 ..> Repo

note bottom of User
  Agregát zde implementuje rozhraní Symfony Security.
  Je to kompromis malého příkladu – v plné architektuře
  patří na security adaptér v infrastruktuře.
end note

@enduml
